  "applies_to": "TECO-Westinghouse F510 HVAC inverters using the built-in RS-485 port (CN6) in Modbus mode, per communication addendum DOCUMENT-TECO-F510-AC001 Ver01 (2015-03).",
  "summary": "The F510 is TECO-Westinghouse's HVAC fan and pump inverter; its RS-485 port supports Modbus RTU/ASCII as well as BACnet MS/TP and Metasys N2. Run/stop and frequency (0.01 Hz) are written to 2501H/2502H, and status, fault and warning codes and monitors are read from 2520H-252FH. Each parameter nn-mm has its own register, with the group in the high byte and the number in the low byte.",
  "transport": [
    "RTU",
    "ASCII"
  ],
  "defaults": {
    "unit_id": null,
