    "parity": null,
    "data_bits": null,
    "stop_bits": null,
    "tcp_port": null
  },
  "addressing": {
    "convention": "hex 0-based",
    "note": "Register numbers are hex and sent unchanged (2520H is sent as 25 20). Parameters map group to the high byte and number to the low byte, except 12-00 which is 32-bit at 2510H (high word) / 2511H (low word)."
  },
  "default_word_order": null,
  "firmware": null,
  "source": {
    "title": "F510 Communication Addendum Modbus RTU/ASCII, BACnet, Metasys N2",
    "doc_number": "DOCUMENT-TECO-F510-AC001 Ver01",
    "revision_date": "2015-03",
    "url": "https://tecowestinghouse.com/PDF/F510_comm_addendum.pdf",
    "pages": "pp. 1-1 to 1-4 (connection, frames, exceptions), p. 1-5 (command data), pp. 1-6 to 1-8 (monitor data), parameter registers from p. 1-13, network p. A-1"
  },
  "notes": [
    "Unlike the A510/E510 Compact addenda, the F510 monitor table prints no units for 2523H, 2524H, 2526H and 2527H, so they are listed raw.",
    "The addendum does not name the drive parameters for node address, baud rate, parity or run/frequency source; set those per the F510 manual.",
    "2521H (faults) and 2528H (warnings) are code tables, mapped as enums.",
    "Left out: 2507H DO, 2529H digital output state (no bit list), 252CH/252DH analog inputs (no unit).",
    "Parameter 12-00 is 32-bit (2510H high word, 2511H low word) and is not listed."
  ],
